# Favicon.ico Placeholder

This is a placeholder for the favicon.ico file. 

To generate a proper favicon.ico:
1. Create a 32x32 PNG version of the logo
2. Use a tool like https://realfavicongenerator.net/ or https://favicon.io/ to generate the .ico file
3. Replace this file with the generated favicon.ico

The favicon.svg in this directory can be used as the source.